direction: right

lstm: LSTM 内部结构详情 {
  shape: package
  style: {
    stroke: "#2563eb"
    stroke-width: 2
    fill: transparent
  }

  c_prev: "c_{t-1}\n(上一时刻记忆)" { shape: cylinder; style.stroke: "#16a34a" }
  h_prev: "h_{t-1}\n(上一时刻隐藏状态)" { shape: cylinder; style.stroke: "#16a34a" }
  x: "x_t\n(当前输入)" { shape: parallelogram; style.stroke: "#2563eb" }

  f: "f_t\n忘多少" { shape: rectangle; style.stroke: "#ca8a04" }
  i: "i_t\n写多少" { shape: rectangle; style.stroke: "#2563eb" }
  c_tilde: "\tilde{c}_t\n新内容" { shape: rectangle; style.stroke: "#9333ea" }
  o: "o_t\n输出多少" { shape: rectangle; style.stroke: "#dc2626" }
  
  mul_f: "\times" { shape: circle }
  add_c: "+" { shape: circle }
  mul_i: "\times" { shape: circle }
  act_c: "\tanh" { shape: oval }
  mul_o: "\times" { shape: circle }

  c_curr: "c_t\n(长期记忆)" { shape: cylinder; style.stroke: "#16a34a" }
  h_curr: "h_t\n(当前输出/短期状态)" { shape: cylinder; style.stroke: "#16a34a" }

  h_prev -> f
  x -> f
  h_prev -> i
  x -> i
  h_prev -> c_tilde
  x -> c_tilde
  h_prev -> o
  x -> o

  c_prev -> mul_f
  f -> mul_f
  mul_f -> add_c
  
  i -> mul_i
  c_tilde -> mul_i
  mul_i -> add_c
  
  add_c -> c_curr
  add_c -> act_c
  
  act_c -> mul_o
  o -> mul_o
  mul_o -> h_curr
}

note: |md
  **关键结论**：
  LSTM 可以理解为在 Vanilla RNN 的 `h_t` 之外，
  额外引入了一条更适合长期传递信息的**记忆通道 `c_t`**，
  并用门控机制严格控制“忘多少、写多少、输出多少”。
| {
  shape: rectangle
  style.fill: transparent
  style.stroke: "#ca8a04"
}

lstm -> note { style.stroke: transparent }
